    <h2>Realistic CPE Calculation Scenarios Across Platforms</h2>
    <p>
      To see how Cost Per Engagement benchmarks apply in real-world marketing, review these four multi-platform scenarios:
    </p>

    <div class="step-guide">
      <div class="step-item">
        <h3>Scenario A: Instagram Influencer Carousel Collaboration (Beauty & Skincare)</h3>
        <p><strong>Campaign Spend:</strong> $800.00 Creator Fee</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Interactions:</strong> 3,200 Likes + 450 Comments + 850 Saves + 500 Story Link Taps = <strong>5,000 Total Engagements</strong></li>
          <li><strong>CPE Calculation:</strong> <code>$800.00 / 5,000 = $0.160 CPE</code></li>
          <li><strong>Cost Per 1,000 Engagements:</strong> $160.00 CPKE</li>
          <li><strong>Assessment:</strong> <strong>Highly Efficient ($0.160)</strong> — Exceptional audience trust and high save velocity.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <h3>Scenario B: TikTok Spark Ads Viral Product Launch (Athletic Apparel)</h3>
        <p><strong>Campaign Spend:</strong> $450.00 Paid Ad Spend</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Interactions:</strong> 4,500 Video Plays (6s+) + 1,200 Hearts + 150 Comments + 200 Shares = <strong>6,050 Total Engagements</strong></li>
          <li><strong>CPE Calculation:</strong> <code>$450.00 / 6,050 = $0.074 CPE</code></li>
          <li><strong>Cost Per 1,000 Engagements:</strong> $74.38 CPKE</li>
          <li><strong>Assessment:</strong> <strong>Highly Efficient ($0.074)</strong> — Strong organic viral lift reducing paid ad cost.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <h3>Scenario C: LinkedIn Sponsored Article & Document Ad (B2B SaaS)</h3>
        <p><strong>Campaign Spend:</strong> $1,200.00 Meta/LinkedIn Ad Spend</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Interactions:</strong> 280 Reactions + 65 Comments + 110 Whitepaper Downloads + 145 Link Clicks = <strong>600 Total Engagements</strong></li>
          <li><strong>CPE Calculation:</strong> <code>$1,200.00 / 600 = $2.000 CPE</code></li>
          <li><strong>Cost Per 1,000 Engagements:</strong> $2,000.00 CPKE</li>
          <li><strong>Assessment:</strong> <strong>Standard B2B Benchmark ($2.000)</strong> — High unit cost justified by $5,000+ enterprise deal values.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="step-item">
        <h3>Scenario D: YouTube Integrated Sponsorship Engagement Audit (Tech Gear)</h3>
        <p><strong>Campaign Spend:</strong> $1,500.00 Sponsorship Fee</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Interactions:</strong> 450 Comment Discussions + 350 Description Link Clicks + 200 Social Shares = <strong>1,000 Total Engagements</strong></li>
